    "description": "The Traffic Management Office (TMO) executes secure, rapid, and compliant transport logistics for personnel, personal property, and military cargo. The primary safety mission of this work center is to execute high-tempo distribution operations while maintaining a zero-mishap, fully compliant safety program in accordance with DAFMAN 91-203.\n\n",
